<title>MEXICO: Mexico 28-day TIIE, TIIP interest rates fall.</title>
<headline>Mexico 28-day TIIE, TIIP interest rates fall.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day TIIE or &quot;equilibrium&quot; interbank interest rate fell to 26.36 percent Wednesday from 26.41 PCT on September 10, the Mexican Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The TIIP 28-day rate, which is set weekly and is being gradually phased out, fell to 26.3821 percent from 28.2007 percent last week, it added.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom 525 7289500</p>
